---
layout: page
title: Key Characters
---

<!-- Index of all character pages: anything under /characters/ except this
     index itself. Titles and blurbs come from each page's front matter. -->

<p>
  Every week's overview lists the key characters for that week's readings. The
  pages gathered here go deeper: who each person was, what Scripture records of
  them, artwork from the church's long tradition of picturing them -- always an
  artist's interpretation, never a photograph -- and links to the places where
  their stories unfolded.
</p>

<%
  chars = site.collections.pages.resources
              .select { |r| r.relative_url.start_with?("/characters/") && r.relative_url != "/characters/" }
              .sort_by { |r| r.data.title.to_s.sub(/\AThe /, "") }
%>

<ul class="location-index">
  <% chars.each do |ch| %>
    <li>
      <a href="<%= relative_url ch.relative_url %>"><strong><%= ch.data.title %></strong></a>
      <% if ch.data.blurb %><span class="location-index-blurb"><%= ch.data.blurb %></span><% end %>
    </li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
